OL,3,AThe grads ditching the UK for a fresh
OL,4,Astart abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year Rachel James quit her
OL,7,Fcorporate job in London, packed a
OL,8,Fsuitcase and booked a one-way ticket to
OL,9,FSydney, without a job lined up or a
OL,10,Fplan in place.
OL,12,F"I went for a fresh start," says the
OL,13,F26-year-old from Surrey. "To take a
OL,14,Frisk and try something completely
OL,15,Fdifferent. With the worst case being
OL,16,Fthere will always be a flight home if
OL,17,Fall fails."
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
