OL,3,AThe grads ditching the UK for a fresh
OL,4,Astart abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than one in 10 UK university
OL,7,Fstudents are now planning to move
OL,8,Fabroad for better opportunities after
OL,9,Fthey have graduated, up from 7.8% two
OL,10,Fyears ago, according to a survey of
OL,11,F15,000 final year university students.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, a study by the Institute of
OL,14,FStudent Employers (ISE) says that
OL,15,Fcompetition for graduate jobs in the UK
OL,16,Fwas at a three-decade high.
